Model weights (release archives only; not in this repository)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The DVLT model weights (the nvidia/dvlt checkpoint) are NOT part of this source
repository. They are released separately by NVIDIA under the NVIDIA License
(non-commercial; research and evaluation use only). setup.bat fetches them from
https://huggingface.co/nvidia/dvlt, and the release archives of dvlt.cu-windows
redistribute the converted blob (model/weights.dvlt) under that same license,
with its full text alongside as model/LICENSE.txt, as the license requires.
Your use of the weights is governed by the NVIDIA License, not by this
project's Apache-2.0 license.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Windows port (dvlt.cu-windows)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This repository is a Windows port of dvlt.cu, based on yassa9/dvlt.cu commit
440a9f5 (2026-06-04): native MSVC/CUDA build, cross-platform file mapping,
list-file input, EXIF orientation, the -k/-x/-e options, and the
reconstruct / long-sequence / post-processing wrappers. The port is likewise
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE); the upstream
notice above is retained unchanged.

Release archives additionally contain cublasLt64_12.dll, the NVIDIA cuBLASLt
runtime, redistributed under the NVIDIA CUDA Toolkit EULA as a listed
redistributable runtime library.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This software bundles or builds against CUTLASS (NVIDIA, BSD-3-Clause) and
stb_image (Sean Barrett, MIT or Public Domain), and reimplements algorithms
adapted via DVLT from DINOv2, PyTorch3D, MoGe, MultiNeRF, Depth-Anything-3, and
AnyCalib. See THIRD_PARTY.md for full attribution and license texts.
